  "metadata": {
    "description": "Worker pool pattern: UPDATE_GOAL sets intent, 3 parallel CLAIM nodes atomically pull tasks from a shared queue, GUARD skips empty claims, THINK workers process in parallel, CHECKPOINT saves intermediate state, WAIT_ALL syncs, ASK aggregates, UMEM persists to LTM, UPDATE_GOAL marks done.",
